<chapter xml:id="ch-sports-database">
  <title>Storing and extracting sports scores in a database</title>

  <introduction>
  <p>
    Databases are very important in any computing environment and often in Scientific Computing if you have a lot of
    data, then a database is the proper way to store the data.
    This chapter covers some techniques that the author uses to store sports scores and how to extract information
    efficiently.
  </p>
  <p>
    You will read a set of CSV files below into a database.  This may be a bit overkill for this situation, but gives an idea how to do this. 
  </p>
</introduction>
